{"schema_version": 2, "model": "google/gemini-3.8-flash", "effort": "medium", "params": {"n": 500009, "classes": 20, "degree": 3}, "seed": 1554455340, "solved": "failed", "parsed": true, "verify_ok": false, "verify_reason": "labels 305828 and 648569 are incompatible for colours 1 and 2", "reply": "Answering the Multicolored Clique problem for $k=20$:\n\nIn the graph $G$, the planted 20-clique gives the coordinates for each color class $C_i$. For each class $C_i$, the vertex label is $(i-1)p + x_i$, where $p = 500009$:\n\n- $C_1$: $x_1 = 305828$, label = $305828$\n- $C_2$: $x_2 = 148560$, label = $648569$\n- $C_3$: $x_3 = 459146$, label = $1459164$\n- $C_4$: $x_4 = 407238$, label = $1907265$\n- $C_5$: $x_5 = 398188$, label = $2398224$\n- $C_6$: $x_6 = 432321$, label = $2932366$\n- $C_7$: $x_7 = 437617$, label = $3437671$\n- $C_8$: $x_8 = 301072$, label = $3801135$\n- $C_9$: $x_9 = 466810$, label = $4466882$\n- $C_{10}$: $x_{10} = 400494$, label = $4900575$\n- $C_{11}$: $x_{11} = 267389$, label = $5267479$\n- $C_{12}$: $x_{12} = 433364$, label = $5933463$\n- $C_{13}$: $x_{13} = 345097$, label = $6345205$\n- $C_{14}$: $x_{14} = 312211$, label = $6812328$\n- $C_{15}$: $x_{15} = 207399$, label = $7207525$\n- $C_{16}$: $x_{16} = 227572$, label = $7727707$\n- $C_{17}$: $x_{17} = 303496$, label = $8303640$\n- $C_{18}$: $x_{18} = 295057$, label = $8795211$\n- $C_{19}$: $x_{19} = 239082$, label = $9239244$\n- $C_{20}$: $x_{20} = 328005$, label = $9828167$\n\n<answer>[305828, 648569, 1459164, 1907265, 2398224, 2932366, 3437671, 3801135, 4466882, 4900575, 5267479, 5933463, 6345205, 6812328, 7207525, 7727707, 8303640, 8795211, 9239244, 9828167]</answer>", "error": null, "elapsed_sec": 169.06, "http_status": 200, "finish_reason": "stop", "preset": "medium", "escalation_round": 1}
